{"completed": true, "response": "{\"better\":\"Y\",\"regress\":\"有，Y有些“话”压得很短，人物动机的因果连接偶尔不如X的完整句子顺。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"Y\",\"point\":\"Y\",\"why\":\"X\",\"whole\":\"Y\",\"fine\":\"Y\"},\"why\":\"Y的“话”先给出短而明确的剧情骨架，【】又把每段真正要抓的词钉住，再让感受按音乐时点出现，所以边听边扫时更容易知道自己现在看到哪一层、这一刻为什么变。X的人物因果写得更完整，但右侧大量短词常像同时铺开的注释，尤其短停留段里容易只抓到零散情绪；Y把音乐动作、身体感觉、记忆和犹疑串在同一条变化线上，细腻度和前后连续感更强。\"}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "765d3d61-9391-47a4-9567-86368a016a4b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T044431629792Z", "elapsed_seconds": 8.297, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T04:44:39.944482+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "8afe271e919ad05a52d314d8d9e479f1e59766381c003452eb8d3faeeda2acd9", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"